[00:00.00] 作词 : 许弘毅
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Kenix Cheang/舒文
[00:02.00] 编曲 : Ted Lo/Kenix Cheang
[00:03.00] 监制 : 舒文
[00:05.98]Drums by：Anthony Fernades
[00:06.13]Bass by：Ho Chun Kit
[00:06.56]Harmonica by：CY Leo
[00:07.31]Chorus by：容祖儿
[00:07.47]String Arranged by：Ted Lo
[00:07.62]Performed by：BJ String
[00:07.87]Recorded by：Kim Lee/Titus/Shuiming Lok/肥丘/舒文@Zoo Music Studio
